===Word formation===
Baliscano has productive derivational morphology:

'''Prefixes:'''
* ''des-'' (undo): ''hasa'' → ''desasa'' "do → undo"
* ''re-'' (again): ''haze'' → ''rehaze'' "do → redo"
* ''in-/im-'' (not): ''posible'' → ''imposible'' "possible → impossible"

'''Suffixes:'''
* ''-dor'' (agent): ''trabaja'' → ''trabajador'' "work → worker"
* ''-dad'' (quality): ''bon'' → ''bondad'' "good → goodness"
* ''-mente'' (adverb): ''rapido'' → ''rapidamente'' "quick → quickly"

