'''Accent marks:'''
* Acute (´): Marks irregular stress (''ká-fe'' "coffee")
* Diaeresis (¨): Indicates pronunciation of u after g or q (''lingüista'' "linguist")
* Grave (`): Distinguishes homographs (rare)

