==Literature==
{{Main|Baliscano literature}}

Baliscano has a rich literary tradition dating to the 19th century:

===Early literature (1830-1900)===
* ''Canto a la Terra'' (1845) – Epic poem by [[Francesc Soler i Vidal]]
* ''La Vida del Pueblo'' (1862) – Novel by [[Maria da Silva Campos]]
* ''Teatro Popular'' (1870s) – Collection of popular plays

===Modern literature (1900-present)===
* Modernist movement in poetry and prose
* Realist novels addressing social issues
* Strong tradition of political and social commentary
* Growing indigenous language literature

